{"1":{"step":[[1,2,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"2":{"step":[[2,3,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">这里崇尚科学  理性与秩序  小梅斯梅尔</span>","<size=38>這裡崇尚科學  理性與秩序  小梅斯梅爾</size>","<size=38>A world that champions science, rationality, and order.</size>","<size=38>이곳은 과학, 이성, 그리고 질서를 숭상하는 곳이야</size>","<size=38>ここは科学と理性と秩序を重んじる地</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"3":{"step":[[3,4,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">我想  你应该会喜欢这里  你大可当作一次公费旅游</span>","<size=38>我想  你應該會喜歡這裡  你大可當作一次公費旅遊</size>","<size=38>I think you might like it here after all, Mesmer. Think of it as a paid vacation.</size>","<size=38>넌 마음에 들 것 같은데, 메스머 주니어. 여행이라 생각하면 어때?</size>","<size=38>メスメルなら気に入るんじゃないかな 旅行だと思って楽しんで</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"4":{"step":[[4,5,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">这我倒不会否认</span>","<size=38>這我倒不會否認</size>","<size=38>I won't deny the appeal.</size>","<size=38>그 점은 부정하지 않겠어</size>","<size=38>そうね</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"5":{"step":[[5,21,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">但跟同事一起的话  应该叫作“出差”</span>","<size=38>但跟同事一起的話  應該叫作“出差”</size>","<size=38>But since I'm here with you two, I'd call this a business trip at best.</size>","<size=38>하지만 동료와 함께하는 이상, 엄연히 ‘출장’이라고 불러야 맞지</size>","<size=38>同僚と一緒だし 旅ではなく「出張」だけど</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"6":{"step":[[6,7,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">她们看起来  很美</span>","<size=38>她們看起來  很美</size>","<size=38>They look ... beautiful.</size>","<size=38>정말... 아름답네</size>","<size=38>とても…綺麗だね</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"7":{"step":[[7,8,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">将情感投射在机器人身上</span>","<size=38>將情感投射在機器人身上</size>","<size=38>They gave these robots emotions?</size>","<size=38>이 로봇들에게 감정을 준 거야?</size>","<size=38>ロボットを心の拠り所に？</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"8":{"step":[[8,22,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">没错  我们的人工智能完全能够承担起一名好伴侣的责任</span>","<size=38>沒錯  我們的人工智慧完全能夠承擔起一名好伴侶的責任</size>","<size=38>Our artificial intelligence models allow them to serve as your very own robotic friends!</size>","<size=38>저희 인공지능 모델 덕분에 이들이 여러분의 동반자로서 충실히 봉사할 수 있습니다!</size>","<size=38>ええ！　搭載された人工知能のおかげで パートナーとしても働けます！</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"9":{"step":[[9,10,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">检测到异常战斗行为</span>","<size=38>檢測到異常戰鬥行為</size>","<size=38>Detecting abnormal, hostile behavior.</size>","<size=38>비정상적인 적대적 행동을 감지했습니다</size>","<size=38>戦闘行為を検知しました</size>","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,23,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"font-size:105%\">噢  被你们发现了呢  双生舞伶</span>","<s